  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1602.31 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1602.31 “Person” means “person” as defined in RSA 485-A:2, IX, namely, “any municipality, governmental subdivision, public or private corporation, individual, partnership, or other entity.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
